<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 3.78 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 3.78 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 3.78 percent on Wednesday from 4.20 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said two banks traded on the market in fourteen reported transactions with a total value of 14 million dinars ($20 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
